            "text": "Yes\u2014**early Coca\u2011Cola did contain cocaine**, but not in the way people sometimes imagine.\n\n- Coca\u2011Cola was created in **1886** by John Pemberton.\n- Its original formula used **coca leaf extract**, and coca leaves naturally contain **cocaine alkaloids**.\n- So the drink likely contained a **small amount of cocaine** in its earliest years.\n- Around the **early 1900s**, Coca\u2011Cola began removing the active cocaine alkaloid from the coca extract.\n- Since then, Coca\u2011Cola has used **\u201cspent\u201d or decocainized coca leaves**, which provide flavor compounds but not cocaine.\n\nSo: **yes, originally; no, modern Coca\u2011Cola does not contain cocaine.**",
